Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:09:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix(abuse): register every rate-limited action; limit
 messaging and bookings

- block/unblock/unmatch ran at the silent 5/hour default (handler documented
  10/hour) and unblock shared the unmatch bucket: each now 10/hour per user
- report registered explicitly (5/hour, unchanged)
- new: message-send 60/10 min, conversation-start 20/hour, booking-create
  10/hour per user (429 + Retry-After; booking keeps its HTML redirect path)
- new: login-account 20/15 min per email (used by the next commit)
CSRF and authorization order unchanged: limits run after both.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
